    "Say goodbye to tedious manual typing! Upgrade to Premium to automatically fix tags, fetch 4K artwork, and download lyrics via instant audio fingerprinting. Or, you can choose to continue editing manually." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "قل وداعاً للكتابة اليدوية المملة! اشترك في النسخة المميزة لإصلاح البيانات، وجلب الأغلفة بدقة 4K والكلمات تلقائياً بضغطة واحدة عبر البصمة الصوتية. يمكنك أيضاً اختيار الاستمرار في التعديل يدوياً."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Digues adéu a l'avorrit tecleig manual! Actualitza a Premium per corregir etiquetes, obtenir portades 4K i lletres automàticament mitjançant l'empremta d'àudio. També pots optar per continuar editant manualment."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sbohem zdlouhavému ručnímu psaní! Přejděte na Premium a opravujte tagy, stahujte 4K obaly a texty automaticky jedním klepnutím pomocí zvukového otisku. Můžete také pokračovat v ruční úpravě."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slut med kedeligt manuelt tastearbejde! Opgrader til Premium for automatisk at rette tags, hente 4K-covers og sangtekster med ét tryk via lydfingeraftryk. Du kan også vælge at fortsætte manuelt."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schluss mit mühsamer manueller Eingabe! Upgrade auf Premium, um Tags automatisch zu korrigieren, 4K-Cover und Songtexte blitzschnell per Audio-Fingerprinting zu laden. Alternativ kannst du manuell fortfahren."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ξεχάστε την κουραστική χειροκίνητη πληκτρολόγηση! Αναβαθμίστε σε Premium για αυτόματη διόρθωση ετικετών, λήψη εξωφύλλων 4K και στίχων με ένα πάτημα μέσω αποτυπώματος ήχου. Μπορείτε να συνεχίσετε χειροκίνητα."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend less time editing tags. Upgrade to Premium to identify songs with audio fingerprinting and automatically find 4K artwork, lyrics, and other tags. You can also keep editing manually."
          }
        },
        "en-AU" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend less time editing tags. Upgrade to Premium to identify songs with audio fingerprinting and automatically find 4K artwork, lyrics, and other tags. You can also keep editing manually."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend less time editing tags. Upgrade to Premium to identify songs with audio fingerprinting and automatically find 4K artwork, lyrics, and other tags. You can also keep editing manually."
          }
        },
        "en-IN" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spend less time editing tags. Upgrade to Premium to identify songs with audio fingerprinting and automatically find 4K artwork, lyrics, and other tags. You can also keep editing manually."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Olvídate de la tediosa escritura manual! Pásate a Premium para corregir etiquetas, obtener portadas 4K y letras automáticamente con un solo toque mediante la huella de audio. También puedes elegir seguir editando a mano."
          }
